.env.bak*

# Environment and database dumps that were committed before .gitignore covered
# them. They carried a live APP_KEY and database passwords, so they are removed
# from tracking and from history; the values themselves still have to be
# rotated, because rewriting history does not un-leak a secret that was already
# cloned. The contents of the current .env belong in Doppler, not in the repo.
.env.local-mariadb.bak
.env.pre-redis.bak
acl-dump.txt
*.sql
*.sql.gz
